sequenceDiagram
    actor Agent as CX agent
    participant UI as CX workspace
    participant Service as CX service
    participant Fixtures as Carrier fixtures
    participant RAG as Policy retrieval
    participant Models as Gemini models
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Agent->>UI: Paste message, order ID or phone
    UI->>Service: Message and optional identifiers
    opt Live mode with unclear local intent
        Service->>Models: Extract intent at T=0.0
        Models-->>Service: Schema-validated route
    end
    Service->>Fixtures: Exact order or unique phone, check agreement
    Fixtures-->>Service: Status, location, ETA and uncertainty
    alt Missing details, conflict, failure or manual decision
        Service-->>UI: Request information or show next owner step
    else Matching tracking record
        Service->>RAG: Message, intent and order status
        RAG-->>Service: Relevant example policy clauses
        opt Live mode needing careful wording
            Service->>Models: Draft Hinglish reply at T=0.4
            Models-->>Service: Schema-validated reply
        end
        opt Gemini wrote the reply
            Service->>Models: Check carrier and dates at T=0.1
            Models-->>Service: Schema-validated audit
        end
        Service->>Service: Run deterministic fact checks
        Service-->>UI: Facts, policies, reply and follow-up flags
        Agent->>UI: Edit reply, save draft or confirm review
        UI->>DB: Save draft or request approval as MVP team
        DB->>DB: Recheck final text, revision and saved facts
        DB-->>UI: Saved result and content-hash audit
        UI-->>Agent: Approved reply and Freshdesk demo link
    end
